{"id": "1827774", "name": "גבול מהצורה 1 בחזקת אינסוף – טריגונומטרי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q5_SPECIAL_LIMITS_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 4px;\">גבול מהצורה 1 בחזקת אינסוף – טריגונומטרי</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">חשבו את הגבול</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac{1+\\tan\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)}{1+\\sin\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)}\\right)^{1/\\sin\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>בדיקת ההקלדה</strong><br>[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q5_SPECIAL_LIMITS_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;\">\n<p>נכתוב את הבסיס כ־\\(\\displaystyle1+u\\left(x\\right)\\), כאשר</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle u\\left(x\\right)=\\frac{\\tan\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)-\\sin\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)}{1+\\sin\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)}\\)</div>\n<p>אם \\(\\displaystyle L\\) הוא הגבול, אז</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ln L=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\ln\\left(1+u\\left(x\\right)\\right)}{u\\left(x\\right)}\\cdot\\frac{u\\left(x\\right)}{\\sin\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)}\\)</div>\n<p>הגורם הראשון שואף ל־\\(\\displaystyle1\\). בגורם השני נשתמש ב־\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{\\tan\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)}{x}\\to{{CT:3}}\\), \\(\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sin\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)}{x}\\to{{CT:4}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sin\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)}{x}\\to{{CT:5}}\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{u\\left(x\\right)}{\\sin\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)}=\\frac{{{CT:6}}}{{{CT:5}}}\\)</div>\n<p>מכאן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle L=e^{\\frac{{{CT:6}}}{{{CT:5}}}}={{CT:7}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "limit", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: if is(equal(radcan(limit),radcan(ans1))) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "limit"], "nvariants": 50}